  "held": {
    "SM_MusselHeld": "Pivot = pinch point at the gathered byssus tuft; +Z up out of the pinch, a tight bunch of three mussels (5.2-6.3 cm) hangs in -Z, umbos 0.6-1.2 cm below the pivot; the frayed tuft end rises ~0.5 cm above it.",
    "SM_LaverHeld": "Pivot = top pinch where the fronds are gathered; +Z up out of the pinch, three broad limp sheets and two strap fronds hang ~10-14 cm in -Z, wider below."
  },
